    <h1>Can You Use an AI Voice on YouTube and <em>Still Get Paid?</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">Yes. The voice has never been the thing that gets a channel demonetized. A different rule does, most articles never mention it, and the takedown numbers everyone quotes trace back to a source that does not appear to exist.</p>
